WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:02.401
Four numbers sum up a data set.

2
00:00:03.303 --> 00:00:08.003
The mean: add them all, then share equally. Thirty shared by five is six.

3
00:00:08.883 --> 00:00:12.733
The median is the middle value, once they are in order: five.

4
00:00:13.659 --> 00:00:18.359
The mode is the most common, five. The range is eleven take three: eight.
